Error [E0615]: `.expect_fail` only works inside a marker block that declares it
  --> tests/ui/scope_member_outside.jet:2:5
    |
  2 |     .expect_fail {
    |     ^
 Why: a leading-dot member statement resolves against the enclosing `#Marker`'s vocabulary — here there is no such block
 Fix: move it inside a `@Test("…") { … }` block, or write an ordinary statement
